08:50.650 --> 08:54.120
Hang in there, Shouma-kun. Please excite me!

08:54.490 --> 08:58.290
Father, my Gulliver front tail. They made fun of it.

08:58.290 --> 08:59.500
Shouma-kun.

09:02.080 --> 09:04.170
