09:18.770 --> 09:20.230
Kiriko Punch!

09:20.230 --> 09:21.730
Kiriko Beam!

09:22.230 --> 09:23.560
Kiriko Gutter!

09:25.270 --> 09:28.110
You have such amazing Hi-ERO particles.

09:28.110 --> 09:29.980
This is the power of love!

09:29.980 --> 09:34.990
Kiriko-chan, you stole my lips so easily.

09:35.780 --> 09:37.280
