12:29.120 --> 12:31.170
Idiot! Don't complain.

12:31.170 --> 12:34.090
My promotion rides on your success!

12:34.090 --> 12:35.340
Think of me!

12:35.340 --> 12:36.960
That has nothing to do with me!

12:36.960 --> 12:40.090
Well, you're of that age. It can't be helped.

12:40.090 --> 12:43.470
You just want a partner to do perverted things with, right?

12:43.470 --> 12:46.350
Then, I'll be your partner.

12:46.350 --> 12:47.850
Th-That's not it.

12:47.850 --> 12:49.600
It's not good to hold back.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.730
Come on.

12:51.600 --> 12:54.230
Exposed breasts are pretty soft, you know?!

12:54.230 --> 12:56.520
You can touch them as much as you want.

12:56.520 --> 13:00.740
So focus on studying right now and break up with Kiyuna. Got it?!

13:01.450 --> 13:03.490
I love Kiriko-chan!

13:03.490 --> 13:06.030
I won't break up with her, no matter what you say!

13:06.030 --> 13:06.740
Huh?

13:06.740 --> 13:09.540
W-What about my promotion?!

13:06.740 --> 13:11.120
To think that I was going to give in to Chieko-sensei's temptation!

13:11.500 --> 13:14.750
What a terrible man I am! I want to apologize to Kiriko-chan immediately!

13:14.750 --> 13:18.380
I want to tell Kiriko-chan my feelings. I love Kiriko-chan!

13:18.380 --> 13:21.340
I really love you! Kiriko-chan!

13:21.590 --> 13:23.220
Kiyuna-san is in the locker room.

13:23.220 --> 13:24.050
Thank you!

13:27.430 --> 13:29.430
