13:29.970 --> 13:31.980
I love you, Kiriko-chan!

13:33.060 --> 13:34.810
Nooo!

13:35.940 --> 13:36.980
Shouma-kun?

13:38.520 --> 13:40.280
I'm sorry, are you all right?!

13:40.940 --> 13:43.110
I-I'm fine. I'm fine.

13:43.110 --> 13:44.280
I'm sorry.

13:46.870 --> 13:48.240
Are you hurt anywhere?

13:48.740 --> 13:50.290
This is nothing.

13:52.160 --> 13:57.380
More importantly, every moment I spend with you makes me happy.

13:57.380 --> 13:59.300
Shouma-kun, me too!

14:02.590 --> 14:06.260
That's right. I will live with the love from Shouma-kun.

14:07.550 --> 14:11.180
But, do I have that right?

14:14.690 --> 14:16.400
Hey, we meet again.

14:16.400 --> 14:18.480
They even appeared in school!

14:18.480 --> 14:20.780
Welcome to the Penguin classroom!

14:21.320 --> 14:23.820
So you're Kiyuna Kiriko.

14:23.820 --> 14:29.080
As a woman who loves Penguins,
we have been ordered to bring you,

14:29.080 --> 14:30.790
