14:41.460 --> 14:45.840
The Penguin-sans ran all the way to the castle, exhausted.

14:45.840 --> 14:49.180
It took three days for their front tails to recover!

14:49.180 --> 14:52.180
Kiyuna Kiriko, we definitely won't forgive you!

14:52.430 --> 14:55.140
Th-That's just blaming others!

14:55.140 --> 14:57.650
