15:22.250 --> 15:24.510
Clam down, I'm sure there are other ways!

15:24.510 --> 15:27.720
I don't really get it, but you get excited over just a kiss?

15:27.720 --> 15:29.640
What do you mean by <i>just</i> a kiss?!

15:29.640 --> 15:32.560
It was really special for us!

15:32.560 --> 15:33.720
Special, huh?

15:33.720 --> 15:37.980
If you're going to be lovey-dovey in front of others, shouldn't you be more bold?

15:37.980 --> 15:38.980
Nelson.

15:38.980 --> 15:40.060
Understood.

15:40.060 --> 15:41.610
What are you doing?

15:42.360 --> 15:43.770
A special service just for you.

15:43.770 --> 15:46.990
I'll teach you newbies a thing or two.

15:46.990 --> 15:48.780
First off, the breasts.

15:49.530 --> 15:53.580
Touch as much as you want today, Nelson.

15:53.580 --> 15:54.950
Roger!

15:54.950 --> 15:56.000
Wait!

15:56.000 --> 15:58.040
I didn't say you could undress them!

15:58.040 --> 15:59.500
I decided to do so on my own!

16:00.000 --> 16:00.750
Stupid.

16:00.750 --> 16:02.670
It is not fair for Nelson to have all the fun.

16:02.670 --> 16:04.550
Let us join too.

16:04.550 --> 16:05.500
No!

16:05.500 --> 16:08.010
That light is the same as Kiriko-chan's?!

16:08.010 --> 16:08.930
All right. Stop.

16:08.930 --> 16:09.680
Roger.

16:09.680 --> 16:12.550
See? Body, touch, and skinship.

16:12.550 --> 16:16.520
We do things like that with Penguin-sans every day.

16:16.770 --> 16:20.230
We're on a different level than some kids who blush for a kiss.

16:20.230 --> 16:22.060
D-Don't look down on us!

16:22.060 --> 16:23.980
I can do something like that as well!

16:23.980 --> 16:25.270
Wait, Kiriko-chan.

16:25.270 --> 16:30.860
Oh, we see? You can? Then, can you do this?

16:32.030 --> 16:36.870
Take a good look. This is a real display of skinship between adults!

16:37.200 --> 16:38.620
God scrub!

16:39.040 --> 16:40.870
Th-There it is!

16:41.370 --> 16:43.380
No! No! No!

16:44.630 --> 16:48.050
Look at that. Looks like it feels really good for Nelson.

16:48.050 --> 16:50.010
Fantastic!

16:50.010 --> 16:52.340
No way! If a girl does something like that...

16:52.340 --> 16:53.800
Any man would be down for the count!

16:53.800 --> 16:55.300
We are Utamaro!

16:55.350 --> 16:57.140
It's finished!

16:57.140 --> 16:57.770
Ah-ugh!

16:58.060 --> 17:00.430
Do you understand? This is a skill of love.

17:00.430 --> 17:02.850
I can't do that.

17:02.850 --> 17:07.280
How pathetic. Now, come with us, Kiyuna Kiriko.

17:07.730 --> 17:11.240
This is bad! I have to get Kiriko-chan excited somehow!

17:11.820 --> 17:12.780
That's it!

17:13.030 --> 17:15.950
Kiriko-chan, believe in me and do as I say.

17:15.950 --> 17:16.780
Y-Yes!

17:17.370 --> 17:20.000
Turn around and lift up your arms.

17:20.870 --> 17:21.790
Like this?

17:27.880 --> 17:30.130
Nooo!

17:30.130 --> 17:31.130
Hi-ERO particles?!

17:31.130 --> 17:32.300
Good! It went well!

17:32.630 --> 17:33.800
Shouma-kun!

17:34.890 --> 17:35.970
You pervert!

17:35.970 --> 17:36.390
Terri-Blugh!

17:36.390 --> 17:37.260
Michael!

17:38.260 --> 17:41.140
You did it! Let's run away through there!

17:41.140 --> 17:42.440
Yeah!

17:42.770 --> 17:43.850
Don't let them escape!

17:44.150 --> 17:45.980
We have to capture them!

17:48.730 --> 17:50.280
Shouma-kun!

17:50.980 --> 17:54.490
Kiyuna Kiriko, you did well to run from us!

17:54.820 --> 17:56.320
Let Shouma-kun down!

17:56.620 --> 18:00.790
We see, during a burst, your Hi-ERO particles are comparable to Kouichi's.

18:00.790 --> 18:05.540
That power would be useful for the Penguin Empire. However!

18:05.540 --> 18:08.340
Hitting Michael deserves the penalty of death!

18:08.590 --> 18:11.090
I'm going to tear you apart, so be prepared!

18:12.090 --> 18:13.340
Kiriko-chan!

18:14.430 --> 18:16.640
Even with the power of Hi-ERO particles,

18:16.640 --> 18:18.300
I can't win against a Penguin robot.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.850
But, at this rate Shouma-kun will get hurt!

18:21.180 --> 18:25.730
Oh, that's right. I should punish you mentally as well.

18:25.730 --> 18:26.850
What are you doing to Shouma-kun?!

18:27.190 --> 18:28.150
Don't you get it?

18:28.150 --> 18:31.360
We will do to your precious boyfriend all the things...

18:30.780 --> 18:31.360
Huh?

18:31.360 --> 18:33.320
...one could think of.

18:31.980 --> 18:33.320
What?!

18:33.320 --> 18:35.360
I'll be gentle, Onii-san!

18:35.360 --> 18:37.370
S-Stop that!

18:37.370 --> 18:39.950
No! You can't do that!

18:43.450 --> 18:47.710
So funny! You're so flustered!

18:47.710 --> 18:50.340
Is he really <i>that</i> important to you?

18:50.340 --> 18:52.800
If you do anything else to Shouma-kun...

18:53.090 --> 18:54.300
What if we do?

18:54.300 --> 18:55.840
What would you do?

18:55.840 --> 18:57.300
Stop!

18:57.300 --> 18:58.930
Here comes the God Scrub!

18:58.930 --> 19:00.260
I'm so jealous!

19:00.260 --> 19:02.310
We are Utamaro!

19:02.310 --> 19:06.560
Kiriko-chan, I love you! No matter what they do to me!

19:06.560 --> 19:09.480
Kiriko-chan is the only girl for me!

19:10.400 --> 19:11.730
Ugh. So disgusting!

19:12.110 --> 19:13.110
Shouma-kun.

19:13.110 --> 19:13.900
Huh?

19:14.360 --> 19:18.360
I have something to confess to you, Shouma-kun.

19:18.360 --> 19:18.910
Huh?

19:19.700 --> 19:21.330
Confess? About what?

19:21.990 --> 19:25.330
I've been lying to you, until now.

19:25.330 --> 19:26.210
Huh?!

19:27.250 --> 19:32.290
But, I can't stand it anymore!
So I'm going to tell you the truth.

19:32.750 --> 19:34.130
Kiriko-chan.

19:34.510 --> 19:41.180
I had to hide this glow in order to live a normal life.

19:42.220 --> 19:46.430
Every day I was scared that I would be found out.

19:47.350 --> 19:50.900
It was at that time that you appeared, Shouma-kun!

19:51.150 --> 19:53.070
I was really surprised.

19:53.070 --> 19:55.900
To think that there was a person who could nullify the light.

19:56.280 --> 19:59.910
And that person liked me, too.

20:00.700 --> 20:04.410
He was a convenient guy who was loyal to me.

20:05.290 --> 20:08.410
I started dating you in order to use you.

20:09.040 --> 20:12.710
So, I'm sorry, Shouma-kun.

20:13.880 --> 20:19.590
No way. You're telling me that this was all a lie?

20:19.590 --> 20:23.180
It hurt me to lie to you this whole time, Shouma-kun.

20:23.970 --> 20:27.680
I was able to finally tell you the truth.

20:28.180 --> 20:29.230
No way.

20:29.730 --> 20:33.770
But, no! Even then, my feelings won't change!

20:33.770 --> 20:35.110
I have one other confession.

20:35.110 --> 20:35.690
Huh?

20:37.440 --> 20:39.530
I love you, Shouma-kun!

20:39.820 --> 20:44.280
You're cool, kind, and smart!
And I love the popular Shouma-kun!

20:44.280 --> 20:47.040
I love the Shouma-kun that loves me!

20:47.040 --> 20:49.250
I am completely obsessed with you.

20:49.250 --> 20:51.500
I can't even sleep at night because of you!

20:51.830 --> 20:55.000
Even when I sleep, my heart races about you in my dreams.

20:55.420 --> 20:58.010
I even think about stupid things,

20:58.010 --> 21:00.260
like if we got married my name would be Ameku Kiriko.

21:00.260 --> 21:05.140
Just by looking at your face, I feel that my heart will stop.

21:05.140 --> 21:07.350
I love you! I really love you!

21:07.350 --> 21:12.940
Kiyuna Kiriko is really, really in love with Ameku Shouma!

21:15.270 --> 21:18.980
You just said that you were dating him in order to use him!

21:18.980 --> 21:20.990
That was in the beginning!

21:21.320 --> 21:24.110
But, I kept falling more and more in love with Shouma-kun.

21:24.110 --> 21:26.530
Right now, I'm head over heels for him!

21:26.530 --> 21:30.120
The first confession was to tell him everything,

21:30.120 --> 21:32.370
because I want to be with him forever!

21:32.370 --> 21:34.000
Hm? I see.

21:34.500 --> 21:36.500
Then you can watch

21:36.500 --> 21:40.630
as we bring down the man you love with our God Scrub!

21:41.260 --> 21:43.430
Stop it!

21:44.010 --> 21:49.270
I don't want to fight and I don't want to lose my peaceful life!

21:49.770 --> 21:52.270
But if it's to protect Shouma-kun...!

21:54.140 --> 21:57.060
Daimidaler, come here!

21:57.190 --> 22:02.530
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

22:02.150 --> 22:08.080
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

22:08.240 --> 22:11.620
Daimidaler: Dispatch!

22:15.500 --> 22:21.170
The darkness is spreading

22:20.880 --> 22:26.590
Why do I keep fighting?

22:26.140 --> 22:37.100
I just don't want to lose these days of peace or the sensation I get to feel with these hands

22:36.810 --> 22:42.650
The sound of moaning gives me power

22:42.110 --> 22:45.200
I won't forgive anyone who tries to take them away

22:48.240 --> 22:50.120
Finishing Move: Finger Beam!

22:50.080 --> 22:55.870
Surge with Hi-ERO particles

22:55.540 --> 23:01.250
Attack when fully charged

23:00.880 --> 23:06.510
Turn that voracious sex drive into strength

23:06.180 --> 23:12.060
Daimidaler the Sound Robot

23:27.400 --> 23:42.420
Next Episode

23:28.950 --> 23:31.030
Since there are front tails,

23:31.030 --> 23:32.330
I'm sure it exists.

23:33.040 --> 23:34.740
A world protected by love.

23:35.910 --> 23:40.170
Next Episode: "Hurrah! Antarctic Number 11 Appears."

23:36.960 --> 23:42.420
Antarctic !Number 11 Appears

23:40.170 --> 23:41.460
Please look forward to it.

23:40.460 --> 23:42.420
Please watch.
